{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"2000000000000020","type":"group","x":-80,"y":280,"width":1600,"height":300,"color":"6","label":"2. Fetch + prepare the video (NEW node added this session)"},
		{"id":"2000000000000030","type":"group","x":-80,"y":640,"width":1600,"height":300,"color":"6","label":"3. Analyze + reply"},
		{"id":"2000000000000002","type":"group","x":-80,"y":-80,"width":1600,"height":240,"color":"6","label":"1. Entry + branch"},
		{"id":"2000000000000040","type":"group","x":-80,"y":1040,"width":1600,"height":160,"color":"2","label":"4. Open decision — not built into the design yet"},
		{"id":"2000000000000001","type":"text","text":"# 🛠️ Reel Pipeline — Step 5: Building the Actual n8n Workflow\nOnly start this once setup steps 1-4 are all ✅ (see reel-pipeline-progress.canvas). Each box below = one n8n node. 🟦 = ready to build once its dependency is done · 🟧 = decision needed first · 🟩 = built & tested.\n**Handles audio+visual reels:** transcript (node 6) AND key frames (node 8) both get sent to Gemini together in node 10 — covers on-screen text / wordless clips, not just speech.\n**Vision model switched to Gemini 2.5 Flash (free tier)** — user requires $0 cost, personal use.","x":-80,"y":-260,"width":1600,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2000000000000010","type":"text","text":"### 🟦 Node: Telegram Trigger\n**What you do:** drag it in, attach the Telegram credential (bot token from setup step 3), set Updates = Message.\n**This is:** the entry point — fires when anyone messages the bot.","x":-40,"y":-20,"width":260,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2000000000000011","type":"text","text":"### 🟦 Node: IF — has video?\n**Condition:** `{{ $json.message.video }}` exists.\n**True →** continue right.\n**False →** goes down to the reply node.","x":260,"y":-20,"width":260,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2000000000000012","type":"text","text":"### 🟦 Node: Telegram reply\n\"Send a reel, not text.\"\n(false branch — dead end, workflow stops here for this path)","x":880,"y":70,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2000000000000041","type":"text","text":"### 🟧 Cleanup: delete /tmp/reels files after use?\nNothing currently deletes the downloaded video/audio/frames — they'll pile up on the VPS disk over time.\n**Decide:** add a final Execute Command (`rm`) node, or handle cleanup separately (e.g. a scheduled cron workflow)?","x":-40,"y":1080,"width":500,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"2000000000000031","type":"text","text":"### 🟦 Node: Code — build multimodal prompt\nJS: read transcript text + base64-encode the frame images, assemble Claude's request body (transcript AND frames together — this is the audio+visual fix).","x":-40,"y":700,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2000000000000032","type":"text","text":"### 🟧 Node: HTTP Request — Gemini API\nModel: `gemini-2.5-flash` (free tier: 1,500 req/day, 15/min, no card). Attach Gemini credential (setup step 4).\n**Depends on:** setup step 4 not started yet.","x":360,"y":700,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"2000000000000033","type":"text","text":"### 🟦 Node: Edit Fields — shape output\nPull `title`, `key_points[]`, `key_activities[]` out of Claude's raw response into clean fields.","x":760,"y":700,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2000000000000034","type":"text","text":"### 🟦 Node: Telegram — reply with summary\nSend the shaped output back to the same chat. Phase 1 ends here.","x":1160,"y":700,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2000000000000021","type":"text","text":"### 🟧 Node: HTTP Request — Telegram getFile\n**NEW — wasn't in original design.**\nTelegram only gives a `file_id`, not a URL. Call Telegram's `getFile` API with that id to resolve the real download URL first.\n**Decision needed:** confirm this before building — flagged this session.","x":-40,"y":340,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"2000000000000022","type":"text","text":"### 🟦 Node: Execute Command — yt-dlp\n`yt-dlp -o /tmp/reels/{{id}}.mp4 <resolved url>`\nDepends on: setup step 1 ✅ done.","x":320,"y":340,"width":260,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2000000000000023","type":"text","text":"### 🟦 Node: Execute Command — ffmpeg (audio)\n`ffmpeg -i {{id}}.mp4 {{id}}.mp3`\nDepends on: setup step 1 ✅ done.","x":620,"y":340,"width":260,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2000000000000024","type":"text","text":"### 🟧 Node: Execute Command — whisper.cpp\n`./main -m models/ggml-base.en.bin -f {{id}}.mp3 -otxt`\n**Depends on:** setup step 2 (in progress) — exact flags to confirm once built.","x":920,"y":340,"width":260,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"2000000000000025","type":"text","text":"### 🟦 Node: Execute Command — ffmpeg (frames)\n`ffmpeg -i {{id}}.mp4 -vf fps=1/3 {{id}}_f%d.jpg`\n~1 frame every 3s, covers visual-only content.","x":1220,"y":340,"width":260,"height":200,"color":"5"}
	],
